      </div>
      <div class="reveal">
        <span class="font-display text-3xl text-clay/40 font-semibold">02</span>
        <h3 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold mt-2">Book &amp; pay</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-dusk/70 mt-2 leading-relaxed">Choose instant or scheduled and pay securely. Auto-refund if a consult can't complete.</p>
